{"code":0,"data":{"title":"通用文件上传接口","content":"<h2 id=\"s-ka6wrfgc\">app.upload.file</h2><p>功能描述：通用文件上传接口</p><p></p><h2 id=\"s-2hqy11li\">环境信息</h2><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>环境</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>HTTPS地址</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>正式环境</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>https://developer-api.vivo.com.cn/router/rest</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><h2 id=\"s-qxh4cwjr\">公共参数</h2><p>调用任何一个API都必须传入的参数，目前支持的公共参数有：</p><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>参数名称</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>参数类型</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>是否必须</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>参数描述</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>method</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>接口名称：app.upload.file</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>access_key</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>申请API传包服务成功后vivo开放平台分配开发者接入的access_key。</p><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://dev.vivo.com.cn/documentCenter/doc/326\">具体获取说明</a>&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>timestamp</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>时间戳（毫秒）示例：1567945333425，允许客户端请求最大时间误差为20分钟。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>format</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>响应格式。默认值：json。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>v</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>API协议版本，可选值：1.0。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>sign_method</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>签名的摘要算法，可选值为：hmac。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>sign</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>API输入参数签名结果，<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://dev.vivo.com.cn/documentCenter/doc/327#w1-84225273\">签名算法参照下面的介绍</a>。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>target_app_key</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>被调用的目标key，可选值：developer。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><h2 id=\"s-190qjdck\">请求参数</h2><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>请求方式</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"3\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>POST</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>参数名称</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>类型</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>是否必填</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>字段说明</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>packageName</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>应用包名</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>file</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>multipart/form-data</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>上传的文件</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>fileType</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Integer</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>文件类型</p><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"78\" style=\"width: 78px\"><p>类型</p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"78\" style=\"width: 78px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>26</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>版权证明授权书，上传的文件要求</p><p>文件小于5M，支持格式：jpg/jpeg/png。</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><h2 id=\"s-47z6vrc4\">响应参数</h2><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>参数名称</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>类型</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>是否返回</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>字段说明</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>code</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>int</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>返回码</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>msg</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>信息描述</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>subCode</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>请求子返回码</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>data</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Object</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>上传后的文件信息。上传失败时不返回此参数。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>packageName</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>包名</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>serialnumber</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>文件上传成功的后流水号</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><h2 id=\"s-fppx0upr\">响应示例</h2><pre><code>成功示例：\n{\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"code\":0,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"msg\":\"成功\"，\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"subCode\"&nbsp;:&nbsp;\"0\",\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"data\":&nbsp;{\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"packageName\":&nbsp;\"com.test.test\",\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"serialnumber\":&nbsp;\"210c5cbc67fdded24245eec7ff5d605c\"\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}\n&nbsp;}\n\n失败示例：\n{\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"code\":10001,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"msg\":\"签名校验失败\"\n}\n\n业务失败示例\n{\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"code\":0,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"subCode\":\"13001\",\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"msg\":\"上传的文件不存在，上传失败\"\n}</code></pre><p></p><h2 id=\"s-m8fpeobf\">业务返回码</h2><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>返回码</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>描述</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>12010</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>当前更新应用正在审核，不允许更新</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>12022</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>当前更新应用待上架，不允许更新</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>13001</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>上传的文件不存在，上传失败</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>13002</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>包名不属于当前开发者</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>13003</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>请检查文件是否正常，文件上传失败</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>13004</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>文件上传服务异常，请稍后再试</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>13005</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>文件类型错误，支持jpg，png</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>13006</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>i文件大小不能超过5MB</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>20008</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>必填参数不能为空</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p>","versionCode":1,"updateTime":1757489504000,"breadCrumbs":"API接口传包,API传包 - 文件上传方式,应用创建、更新,文件上传通用接口","docType":3,"docMessageType":"app_distribution"}}